cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use VectorView, please cite it as below."
title: "VectorView: text search over street-level imagery"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Berkane
    given-names: Thomas
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-18"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/tberkane/VectorView"
url: "https://tberkane.github.io/VectorView/"
abstract: >-
  VectorView finds images of a visual feature, described in plain words, among the Street View
  images of an area. It collects images with the Street View Static API or the streetlevel library,
  embeds images, tiles and patch regions with SigLIP-2, expands queries with an LLM, reranks the top
  results with a vision-language model, and provides a local web app for verifying results and
  refining queries.
keywords:
  - street view
  - image retrieval
  - vision-language models
  - SigLIP
  - public health
